      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.460264,
        "t": 747.674768,
        "r": 527.3423759999995,
        "b": 721.8231569281769
      },
      "content": "When selecting soluble coolant, select one in consideration of the lubrication, settlement, anticorrosive, foaming device, unfixing with oil, safety, and so on.",
      "section_id": "sec_8",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Coolant"
        }
      ],
      "page": 74,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0428",
      "reading_order": 557,
      "section": "8. Coolant",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.45926200000001,
        "t": 713.654864,
        "r": 527.3784479999996,
        "b": 687.8032529281769
      },
      "content": "Before  starting  or  after  stopping  the  work,  remove  chips  and  clean  up  soluble  coolant attached on each wet moving part, tool post turning part, and cross slide.",
      "section_id": "sec_8",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Coolant"
        }
      ],
      "page": 74,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0429",
      "reading_order": 558,
      "section": "8. Coolant",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.61952600000001,
        "t": 679.6950800000001,
        "r": 325.9584120000001,
        "b": 670.823360928177
      },
      "content": "After that, always apply lubrication oil lightly.",
      "section_id": "sec_8",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 1,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Coolant"
        }
      ],
      "page": 74,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
